    - target: {fileID: 8606921339289438144, guid: 4fadf9e47bcae874b968e0e8e8b5263b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'I don''t want you to suffer, that''s why

        I pushed you away.


        You''ll
        never understand,

        but this power is mine-it always was.


        When
        the time comes, you''ll have to choose:

        follow me... or disappear.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
